WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:18.793
Tom ran up to the palace roof.

2
00:00:18.794 --> 00:00:20.960
Roar! Swoosh!

3
00:00:20.961 --> 00:00:28.612
He could hear the dragon coming closer.

4
00:00:28.613 --> 00:00:31.588
Tom stared up at the dragon.

5
00:00:31.589 --> 00:00:34.725
"Whoa," he cried.

6
00:00:34.726 --> 00:00:37.689
The dragon was huge and green.

7
00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:43.828
Flames shot from its mouth.

8
00:00:43.829 --> 00:00:50.958
A peddler was throwing pots at the dragon.

9
00:00:50.959 --> 00:00:54.690
A farmer dropped his milk cart and ran away.

10
00:00:54.691 --> 00:00:59.966
Sizzle! Flags and bushes burned.

11
00:00:59.967 --> 00:01:05.752
The dragon roared loudly and came closer.

12
00:01:05.753 --> 00:01:12.836
It stopped and held its belly and roared again.

13
00:01:12.837 --> 00:01:16.882
"Now!" Dirk yelled to the knights and servants.

14
00:01:16.883 --> 00:01:19.508
"Attack that dragon!"

15
00:01:19.509 --> 00:01:23.025
The knights threw their swords.

16
00:01:23.026 --> 00:01:26.616
The servants threw their boulders.

17
00:01:26.617 --> 00:01:29.866
Other men shot arrows.

18
00:01:29.867 --> 00:01:36.270
Boom! Bam! The dragon swatted everything away.

19
00:01:36.271 --> 00:01:39.483
Hot flames shot from its mouth.

20
00:01:39.484 --> 00:01:44.253
Soon all the weapons were gone.

21
00:01:44.254 --> 00:01:51.263
All the servants and knights were running away.

22
00:01:51.264 --> 00:01:53.979
Dirk glared at Tom.

23
00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.881
"I told you to stay downstairs!

24
00:01:56.882 --> 00:02:00.576
Your magic will never work!"

25
00:02:00.577 --> 00:02:05.294
Dirk ran away too.

26
00:02:05.295 --> 00:02:09.406
Cat slipped out of Tom's pocket.

27
00:02:09.407 --> 00:02:17.419
The dragon breathed again—and Cat's tail caught fire!

28
00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:21.422
"There!" Tom pointed to a bucket of water.

29
00:02:21.423 --> 00:02:26.749
Cat quickly dunked her tail.

30
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.288
"That's a huge dragon!" said Cat.

31
00:02:30.289 --> 00:02:34.853
She jumped back into Tom's pocket.

32
00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:37.963
"Dirk's right!" Tom moaned.

33
00:02:37.964 --> 00:02:46.428
"My magic will never work!"
